     {
      "text": "Quarterly revenue surged 56% from ₹1,975 Cr (Dec 2025) to ₹3,076 Cr (Sep 2026) while PAT nearly quadrupled from ₹100 Cr to ₹398 Cr.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Management expects 95-105% utilization on key nitric acid, nitration and hydrogenation assets, indicating strong capacity absorption.",
      "source_ids": [
       "T:2026-02-01:p12"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Company commands 55-60% share of India's phenolics consumption and targets to maintain this dominance.",
      "source_ids": [
       "T:2026-02-01:p17"
      ]
     }
    ],
    "bear": [
     {
      "text": "Three-year CAGRs show revenue declining -0.4% and PAT falling -13.5%, with operating margin compressing from 16.2% to 12.5%.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Aggressive capex plan of ~₹3,200 Cr this year and ₹3,000 Cr more in 2027-28 could push peak borrowings to ₹8,000-8,500 Cr despite current low 0.27 debt-to-equity.",
